  {
   "id": "t_aca80ff13375de69dd5d",
   "sourceHash": "aca80ff13375de69dd5d30cfa87668e1ee0b4608bf7b22055a4b0ee03f5285c5",
   "text": "图片库",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4a9aabaa238a13b1318b",
   "sourceHash": "4a9aabaa238a13b1318b2e7a042edfc364e2c5db37eb210a75e7647faa8ac1b8",
   "text": "通往宁静之路：在质朴的田园风光与壮美的自然之中寻得平静。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_69f9dd51e18d6da9b8dd",
   "sourceHash": "69f9dd51e18d6da9b8ddea74ea5528c4bd3c2c12528b70489754f411d2ed2b83",
   "text": "接受一次舒缓的阿育吠陀疗法，让您的感官焕发活力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_52ef6e5fc2a6dc20c865",
   "sourceHash": "52ef6e5fc2a6dc20c865be30387af4784d92080394d4110fde37a201801f52b1",
   "text": "迈向身心安康之路：在 Kairali 宁静的自然怀抱中漫步。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_fab0560001f80acadc6a",
   "sourceHash": "fab0560001f80acadc6a6d05d7e476aa18d6ebe91c84bb755b807fbc032883db",
   "text": "在 Kairali 通过正宗的阿育吠陀实现自然疗愈、身心焕活与排毒。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_78afa5613ca03578c980",
   "sourceHash": "78afa5613ca03578c980e8747d35f98de2ebd10f7451e04afc1dda7b4b07e5ec",
   "text": "在 Kairali 于指导下练习瑜伽，寻得内心平静，体验全面的身心安康。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3fcd13b8f0f2fe47ebf2",
   "sourceHash": "3fcd13b8f0f2fe47ebf2e21f7382a0f7a14201fe17932bc814b233872d097206",
   "text": "放松、疗愈、焕活：Kairali 的治疗项目将历久弥新的阿育吠陀融入您追求身心安康的过程。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'quest' rendered as 过程 (process) to keep the clinical register."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1890a6c3990e4dfa8644",
   "sourceHash": "1890a6c3990e4dfa8644c406ef20d79a9486a5e3fcb328832b00d0a1b2d02404",
   "text": "文化盛宴：来到 Kairali，感受喀拉拉邦的古老习俗。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_98f34e16f287ac227022",
   "sourceHash": "98f34e16f287ac2270229684ec6db7c31b39efe8d9a648ae0ba753d330358989",
   "text": "品味安康：在 Kairali 品尝传统阿育吠陀膳食的滋味。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6b362e27dd7148e931cf",
   "sourceHash": "6b362e27dd7148e931cf33bd72de24f4dabaca368b2625a43b38e0804314f28d",
   "text": "借助 Kairali 的 Shirodhara（希罗达拉）疗法舒缓感官，获得极致的平衡与放松。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a1471a472c4e5ec5ee43",
   "sourceHash": "a1471a472c4e5ec5ee432655ee3593c9e3395446df1977388b23bca5e574b995",
   "text": "在 Kairali 宁静的自然庇护所中，发现内在的平衡。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_95f9063a2fa238165489",
   "sourceHash": "95f9063a2fa238165489be52592b06188b04b76072346cff1c7f278cc59712d2",
   "text": "在 Kairali 绿意盎然的宁静环境中练习瑜伽，可以帮助您找到内心的禅定。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f209b22814b0bafe9f46",
   "sourceHash": "f209b22814b0bafe9f46560a2df1831b936948ef40cea38c65393e52e813fa5a",
   "text": "一位身着红色上衣、披金色披巾的女士站在椰树环绕的木栏杆旁",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d975c6345d0451d8c675",
   "sourceHash": "d975c6345d0451d8c675600c2d17fbab1320cd4a660d0ecc995be9e449da9543",
